# Scenario-level override that pins NarayanaTransactionManagerProvider
# as a ServiceLoader candidate. NarayanaTransactionManagerProvider's
# @Priority(Integer.MAX_VALUE - 100) is lower (= higher priority) than
# the default AutoSelectTransactionManagerProvider at
# @Priority(Integer.MAX_VALUE), so the project's ServicePriorityResolver
# picks Narayana as the head -- independent of which JTA-impl profile
# the parent build activated. Without this override AutoSelect would
# probe the classpath and prefer Geronimo under jta-geronimo (the
# activeByDefault profile), defeating this scenario's intent of
# exercising Narayana specifically.
org.os890.jawelte.module.jta.impl.adapter.provider.NarayanaTransactionManagerProvider
